[{"kind":"class","name":"ImageStretchOption","tags":[{"originalTitle":"deprecatedclass","title":"deprecatedclass","text":"SuperMap.ImageStretchOption","value":"SuperMap.ImageStretchOption"},{"originalTitle":"category","title":"category","text":"iServer Image","value":"iServer Image"}],"classdesc":"<p>影像拉伸类。影像拉伸是一种图像/影像处理方式，此类存储了影像拉伸类型和每一种拉伸类型相应的参数，\n从而改善影像质量，使影像中的地物更易辨识。\n此处提供了四种拉伸方式：标准差拉伸、最值拉伸、高斯拉伸以及百分比截断拉伸。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["Object"]},"description":"<p>可选参数。</p>","name":"options"},{"type":{"names":["ImageStretchOption.StretchType"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>影像拉伸类型。该属性的值有以下几种情况：NONE，无拉伸；GAUSSIAN，高斯拉伸；PERCENTCLIP，百分比截断拉伸；MINIMUMMAXIMUM，最值拉伸；STANDARDDEVIATION，标准差拉伸。</p>","name":"options.stretchType"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>标准差系数。</p>","name":"options.stdevCoefficient"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>高斯系数。</p>","name":"options.gaussianCoefficient"},{"type":{"names":["boolean"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>高斯拉伸时，是否使用中间值，若该属性值为 true，表示使用中间值；false，表示使用平均值。</p>","name":"options.useMedianValue"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>使用百分比截断拉伸时，排除影像直方图最低值区域的像元，该参数值为这部分像元占总像元百分比。</p>","name":"options.minPercent"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>使用百分比截断拉伸时，排除影像直方图最高值区域的像元，该参数值为这部分像元占总像元百分比。</p>","name":"options.maxPercent"}],"usage":{"className":"ImageStretchOption","aliasClass":"","globalParams":{"monospaceLinks":true,"cleverLinks":true,"default":{"outputSourceFiles":false},"namespace":"mapboxgl.supermap","moduleName":"mapboxgl","npm":"@supermapgis/iclient-mapboxgl","cdn":"https://iclient.supermap.io/dist/mapboxgl/iclient-mapboxgl.js"},"deprecatedClasses":["SuperMap.ImageStretchOption"],"deprecatedClassInstance":null,"browserNamespace":""},"longname":"ImageStretchOption","scope":"global","usageCodeBrowser":"<script type='text/javascript' src=\"https://iclient.supermap.io/dist/mapboxgl/iclient-mapboxgl.js\"></script>\n<